    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/37d86a50cd4d01321ab79d11b05377ba.avif?t=1753609679\" width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>AEOLIADA</strong>\u00a0\ud83c\udf1f combines fast-paced combat with high fantasy narrative enhanced by the latest AI technology for smart companions, enemies and NPCs.  <br> <br>Key features include:  <br>\ud83c\udfad characters that learn to love you\u00a0\ud83d\udc98 <br>\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0combat intertwined with magic \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <br>\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0high fantasy storytelling\u00a0\u2712\ufe0f  <br> <br>Follow Queen Eudoxia, the last scion of a fading god-bloodline, as she battles to reclaim her dynasty's divine legacy in a world where mortality is a curse and immortality a forbidden dream.\u00a0<br><br>For what has died shall rise again.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1753609679\" data-has-big width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/37d86a50cd4d01321ab79d11b05377ba.avif?t=1753609679\" width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>AEOLIADA</strong>\u00a0\ud83c\udf1f combines fast-paced combat with high fantasy narrative enhanced by the latest AI technology for smart companions, enemies and NPCs.  <br> <br>Key features include:  <br>\ud83c\udfad characters that learn to love you\u00a0\ud83d\udc98 <br>\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0combat intertwined with magic \ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <br>\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0high fantasy storytelling\u00a0\u2712\ufe0f  <br> <br>Follow Queen Eudoxia, the last scion of a fading god-bloodline, as she battles to reclaim her dynasty's divine legacy in a world where mortality is a curse and immortality a forbidden dream.\u00a0<br><br>For what has died shall rise again.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1753609679\" data-has-big width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
